        "tags": [
          "evidence"
        ],
        "summary": "Present Evidence",
        "description": "Present technical evidence only; never ownership or scan authorization.\n\n16 KiB streaming cap; no compression. Required If-Match binds the asset version.\nReplay lasts 24 hours, binds actor/tenant/method/route/document/precondition and\nreturns fresh metadata after authorization. A pending operation is not repeated.",
